    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saag aloo is spiced potato with wilted "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "saag",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "saag"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". It is a dry curry, meaning there is no sauce: the spinach clings to the potato pieces rather than pooling around them. It is best served alongside a sauced main curry. The spinach goes in last and wilts in the heat from the potato."
          }
        ]
      },
